{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lof6987","slide":13,"name":"text-130","text":"T95 = Σ 2H/(H − i)，i = 0 … ⌈0.9H⌉ − 1","textPreview":"T95 = Σ 2H/(H − i)，i = 0 … ⌈0.9H⌉ − 1","textChars":37,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,472,560,40]}
